{title: Kehdoo Tumhe}
{artist: Kishore Kumar R D Burman Asha Bhosle}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am],        keh doon tumhe
[A],        ya chup rahoon
[A] [G],        dil mein mere aaj kya hai
[Am] [G],        jo bolo to jaanoon
[Am],        guru tumko manoon
[Am] [A] [Am],        chalo ye bhi waada hai
[A] [G] [A],        socha hai tumne ki chalte hi jaaye
[A] [G] [A],        taaro se aage koi duniya basaayein
theek hai....aah haan,        to tum batao...bata oon...haan
[A] [G] [A],        socha hai ye ki tumhe rasta bhulaye
[A] [G] [A],        suni jagah pe kahin chhede daraaye
[G],        Are na na hai re naa Na ye na karna
[A],        are nahi re nahi re
[A],        nahi re nahi re nahi re Nahi Re
[A],        nahi re nahi nahi
[Am],        Kehdoon tumhe.....
[A] [G] [A],        socha hai tumne ki kuch gun gunaye
[A] [G] [A],        masti me jhume zara dhoome machaye
ab theek hai...hoon hoon,        to tum batao na...bataa oon..haan
[A] [G] [A],        socha hai ye ki tumhe nazdik laye
[A] [G] [A],        phoolo se hotho ki laali churaye
[G],        Are na na hai re naa Na ye na karna
[A],        are nahi re nahi re
[A],        nahi re nahi re nahi re Nahi Re
[A],        nahi re nahi nahi
[Am],        Kehdoon tumhe.....
